<title>CHINA: Trading in Kwoon Chung Bus suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Kwoon Chung Bus suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company shares ended HK$0.05 down at HK$5.35 on Monday on volume of 1.83 million shares worth HK$9.90 million.</p>
<p>Kwoon Chung is a Hong Kong-based bus line operator.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
